Not included in the repository: Apple software, upstream binaries (XeGfx.kext, built kexts, Mesa, the Metal plugin), Intel GuC
firmware, AirportItlwm and other third-party kexts. The build scripts fetch upstream sources at pinned revisions.
The OpenCore patch in opencore/build_clean07.py contains only the bytes it finds and replaces in AirportItlwm 2.4.0.

GitHub Releases of this repository carry binaries as a backup of a working machine, outside the source tree.
release/THIRD-PARTY.txt lists every binary in them with its origin, licence and source, and release/LICENSES/ holds
the licence texts; both are inside each zip. Left out of the public zips: Apple software (air-opt), AMFIPass (binary
only, no licence) and the ACPI tables made from Lenovo's firmware (release/README-FIRST.txt). The Mac's serial number,
MLB, ROM and SystemUUID are replaced by placeholders. Binaries are provided as is, for non-commercial use only.
